# 960x720 window, TV image at (0,90), size 960x540.
# A click in the upper black bar must not reach the guest.
0 resize 960 720
200 motion 200 20
250 down 1
300 up 1
500 motion 200 240
800 motion 300 310
1100 down 1
1200 up 1
# Wheel: one notch up, one down, then two up in one event; the net delta is +2 notches.
1600 wheel 1
1750 wheel -1
1900 wheel 2
2200 motion 700 490
2500 down 1
2600 up 1
2900 down 1
3000 blur
3300 keydown A
3400 keyup A
# The remote's buttons, as the remote window sends them (LG IR codes to the micom): RED, GREEN,
# YELLOW, BLUE, then BACK (last: it may take the app away).
3600 irdown 0x72
3750 irup 0x72
3900 irdown 0x71
4050 irup 0x71
4200 irdown 0x63
4350 irup 0x63
4500 irdown 0x61
4650 irup 0x61
4800 irdown 0x28
4950 irup 0x28
